    <item>
      <title>伯克希尔CEO警告：美国数据中心建设遭遇全国性强烈抵制</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260902/%E4%BC%AF%E5%85%8B%E5%B8%8C%E5%B0%94CEO%E8%AD%A6%E5%91%8A%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%BE%E9%81%AD%E9%81%87%E5%85%A8%E5%9B%BD%E6%80%A7%E5%BC%BA%E7%83%88%E6%8A%B5%E5%88%B6/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260902/%E4%BC%AF%E5%85%8B%E5%B8%8C%E5%B0%94CEO%E8%AD%A6%E5%91%8A%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%BE%E9%81%AD%E9%81%87%E5%85%A8%E5%9B%BD%E6%80%A7%E5%BC%BA%E7%83%88%E6%8A%B5%E5%88%B6/</guid>
      <description>Greg Abel直言抵制增多，行业扩张信号转向 伯克希尔哈撒韦CEO Greg Abel告诉CNBC，对数据中心建设的抵制已出现“大量更多”。这一阻力正在全美范围内加速蔓延，原本顺利推进的项目正遭遇越来越强的反对。 Greg Abel的表态直接指向行业当前面临的现实转变。此前数据中心项目往往能快速获得地方支</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>长飞光纤净利暴增888%，AI算力需求重塑光通信产业链</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260821/%E9%95%BF%E9%A3%9E%E5%85%89%E7%BA%A4%E5%87%80%E5%88%A9%E6%9A%B4%E5%A2%9E888AI%E7%AE%97%E5%8A%9B%E9%9C%80%E6%B1%82%E9%87%8D%E5%A1%91%E5%85%89%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%A1%E4%BA%A7%E4%B8%9A%E9%93%BE/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260821/%E9%95%BF%E9%A3%9E%E5%85%89%E7%BA%A4%E5%87%80%E5%88%A9%E6%9A%B4%E5%A2%9E888AI%E7%AE%97%E5%8A%9B%E9%9C%80%E6%B1%82%E9%87%8D%E5%A1%91%E5%85%89%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%A1%E4%BA%A7%E4%B8%9A%E9%93%BE/</guid>
      <description>长飞光纤业绩爆发：净利同比增长888.88% 8月21日，长飞光纤发布2026年半年度报告，数据显示公司上半年实现营业总收入98.09亿元，同比增长53.64%；归母净利润达到29.25亿元，同比增幅高达888.88%；扣非净利润为24.49亿元，同比增长1680.48%。经营现金</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>CoreWeave等Neocloud股票受热捧，但分析师警告周期性风险</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260820/CoreWeave%E7%AD%89Neocloud%E8%82%A1%E7%A5%A8%E5%8F%97%E7%83%AD%E6%8D%A7%E4%BD%86%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E5%B8%88%E8%AD%A6%E5%91%8A%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F%E6%80%A7%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9/</link>
